{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is detected, grab it or move to it, then check and process it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = IsObjectClose    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
